# StationAlarm Feature Completion Walkthrough

## Summary of Accomplishments

The StationAlarm application has been successfully updated with all features requested in the PRD.

### UI/UX Improvements
*   **Home Screen (Redesign):** Removed the Floating Action Button (FAB) and integrated a persistent search bar at the top of the Home Screen using Jetpack Compose.
*   **Search Integration:** The Search Screen was removed entirely. Searching now filters the `StationData.STATIONS` directly on the Home Screen. A smooth `Crossfade` animation switches between active alarms and search results.
*   **Visual Flair:** Added 'zoom out' animations and box shadows when the user interacts with `StationCard` and `StationSearchItem` elements to achieve a more dynamic and pleasing aesthetic.
*   **Bottom Sheet:** Integrated custom reminder input (text) and a "Show Reminder" toggle directly into `StationConfigBottomSheet`. The Bottom Sheet remains strictly monochromatic.

### Core Logic & Geofencing
*   **5-Level Geofences:** Modified the `ActiveStation` object to implicitly define five concentric geofences: alert distance + 60km, + 40km, + 30km, + 5km, and the final alert distance. `GeofenceManager` and `StationRepository` correctly register these five levels.
*   **Logging:** A comprehensive `Logger.kt` CSV engine was implemented to track geofence triggers (`GEOFENCE_TRIGGERED`), registrations, location polls, and alerts. Each log persists battery levels and device details.

### Foreground Service & Permissions
*   **Tracking and Feedback:** The `LocationService` was updated to seamlessly log every explicit location poll via `Logger.log()`. It also updates the foreground sticky notification with the phrase "Nearest station: [Name] - [X] km" silently via `.setOnlyAlertOnce(true)`.
*   **Compose Permissions:** Built a custom declarative in-app permission rationale view directly into `MainActivity.kt`. It safely checks for `ACCESS_BACKGROUND_LOCATION` and `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` depending on SDK level, effectively prompting users to click "Settings" and choose "Allow all the time". Also prompts to enable GPS if disabled.

### Full-Screen Alarm 
*   **Alarm Activity:** Integrated a new `AlarmActivity.kt` to trigger when users arrive at a station. It forces the screen to turn on from sleep and keeps the UI active.
*   **Audio Routing:** Modulated Android's `AudioManager` streams so audio plays exclusively through `STREAM_ALARM` at max volume natively.
*   **Volume Key Interception:** Hooked `onKeyDown` within the new activity to automatically dismiss the alarm when the user presses any volume key, removing the active tracking DB entry, stopping audio, and successfully terminating the application's underlying tracking loop.

